description:
[file-pcapng] Added missing values for Darwin-specific options to the `option_code_enhanced_packet_vals`, clarified some comments.

Previously, some options were shown as "unknown" in the `File Format` view:

![Screenshot_2026-03-04_at_8.43.55_AM](/uploads/eef1f93eed2593e0a80abf01d43bc0e3/Screenshot_2026-03-04_at_8.43.55_AM.png){width=900 height=562}

After the fix, the options show up correctly:

![Screenshot_2026-03-04_at_11.09.49_AM](/uploads/edaa3f9fc899a1eb78dc2f1f8569c24c/Screenshot_2026-03-04_at_11.09.49_AM.png){width=626 height=600}

